! mcp_bootstrap_p356.strap -- MCP printed page 356: the $DUMP program's
! field converters: the tail of a 48-bit field store, AMISC (3-bit
! field through the AMISTB table), ATRNST (6-bit field scaled by AL48
! through ATRNTB, then two hex digits through AHXTB), AFLPNT (floating
! point word print: APFL flags, AWDCMP, ACNVER through ALCRF, noisy
! mode, the exponent / fraction tests ALOOP2 / ALOOP4 / ACPLUS),
! lines 1-48.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.106, read at 400 dpi, doubtful
! statements at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID
! 22$DUMP  CARD ID VB000649  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 356";
! the heading row's LOCATION field is 235675, line 1's word.
!
! Still the $DUMP (PUNID 22$DUMP, card IDs VB...); no SLC, no new
! origin, no TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  48 lines; every line number prints a "*".  A "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 11, 24, 40; line 42 prints "42**235736.00" (a second
! "*" between the line number and the location).  Remarks on lines 12
! ("-,"), 33, 40, 41, 42.  Located rows contiguous 235675.40 (line 1) to
! 235743.00 (line 48, a full word; next 235744.00), then blank paper.
!
! JOIN.  p.355 (tools/page_sheet.py 355) ends with LF(BU,8),AHXTB($1)
! at 235674.40, a full word: next 235675.40 = line 1.  p.357 opens at
! 235744.00: contiguous both ways.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "ALCOP2" / "ALCOP4" (NAME, lines 39 and 45): the NAME column
!     prints both rounds open; the statements on lines 39 and 43 print
!     "ALOOP4" with both rounds CLOSED (900 dpi), so the family is
!     ALOOP-: written ALOOP2, ALOOP4.
!   * "CMOCOO" (lines 29, 34, 46): the connective's four-bit mnemonic
!     field is digits; written CM0000 (its partner CM1111 is on the same
!     page).
!   * line 41's operation prints its first glyph worn ("C1111"); no "M".
!     Written C1111 as printed; the assembled last byte (70, not CM's
!     F0) decides between the two.
!   * "$PGC" (line 40): the last glyph is an open round; the program
!     indicators are the digit family PG0..PG6 (bits 41-47) and the row
!     prints 000013.51, indicator word 11 bit 41 = PG0: written $PG0.
!   * octal / hex fields with an open round read 0 ("FO" = F0, "8O" = 80).
!
! Line 42, "E-I,48" (plain ink, 900 dpi), prints 014000.57 60: the bare
! integer is a count in the signed 11-bit field (C28-6129 printed p.33,
! category 4) and E-I defaults to unnormalized (printed p.46).  Until
! 2026-11-06 strap_asm assembled it 000060.17.
!
! EXTERNALS.  None is defined by a landed deck except APCOL1, ALCRFB and
! ALCRF (p.343 stand-ins, copied).  The others are defined on pages not
! yet landed (Vision reading: AWDCMP p.350 line 20, ARETRN p.351 line
! 24, AFLPTI / AEXPF / AFRACI p.358, AL48 / APFL p.359); their data
! descriptions are copied from those readings and their values from
! this page's binary.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  VB000649 .. VB000694.  Shared serials: lines 26-27
! (VB000674, LCI/B pair) and 30-31 (VB000677, SIC/B pair).  None skipped.

ARETRN  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)235377.0    ! p.351 l.24 (V+I, half word); B line 2 235377.10, half word only
AMISTB  SYN, (8)236242.10            ! not landed; LF line 5 236242.10 ($1 in the byte), BIT-EXACT
AL48    SYN(BU,6), (8)236174.00      ! p.359 l.22 DD(BU,6); * line 9 236174.00, BIT-EXACT
ATRNTB  SYN, (8)236234.10            ! not landed; L line 11 236234.10, BIT-EXACT
AHXTB   SYN, (8)236232.10            ! not landed; LF line 15 236232.10, BIT-EXACT
APCOL1  SYN, (8)236105.0             ! as p.343; LVI line 18 236105.35, half word only
APFL    SYN, (8)236221.00            ! p.359 l.49 (A8)DD(BU); TI line 19 236221.00, BIT-EXACT
AFLPTI  SYN(BU,1), (8)236147.01      ! p.358 l.39 DD(BU,1); CM1111 line 23 236147.01, BIT-EXACT
AWDCMP  SYN(BU,64,8), (8)235330.0    ! p.350 l.20 (L, full word); B line 25 235330.10, half word only
AHOTP   SYN, (8)236161.0             ! not landed; LV line 28 236161.34, half word only
ALCRFB  SYN, (8)235373.0             ! as p.343; SIC line 30 235373.00
ALCRF   SYN, (8)235370.0             ! as p.343; B line 31 235370.10, half word only
AEXPF   SYN(BU,1), (8)236147.04      ! p.358 l.42 DRZ(BU,1); CM1111 line 36 236147.04, BIT-EXACT
AFRACI  SYN(BU,1), (8)236017.03      ! p.358 l.43 SYN(BU,1),AFRACS.3; CM0000 line 46 236017.03, BIT-EXACT

        SLC, (8)235675.40
        SF(BU,48),($14)                                      ! line  1
